WEBVTT

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.620
Summer has really hit us full force.

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.620
But summer is the season for love, right?

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:55.760
Coco, Noelle, why are you two so depressed?

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:02.600
Well, we're Mermaid Princesses. We don't have the time to deal with love.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:07.370
That's right. Even though we don't have boyfriends, it isn't something we can do anything about.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:14.660
Coco, Noelle, and Karen are saying that because of their duties as Mermaid Princesses, they don't have time for love.

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:16.810
That's what I heard.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.860
Mermaid Princesses don't need love.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:25.820
Their youth is to be used to keep the seven seas safe.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.660
That's how it is.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.620
Well said, Hippo!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.930
That's right! Mermaid Princess don't need love.

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:35.410
It's a waste of time for Mermaid Princesses to talk about boyfriends.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:38.910
That's right, Coco-san, Noelle-san, Karen-san!

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:43.640
Therefore, you shouldn't be worried that you aren't able to find boyfriends.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:47.610
Mermaid Princesses don't need to mess around with love!

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:48.880
You mustn't be led astray.{You must not go in the wrong direction.}

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:51.310
Ehh!? What did you say just now?

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.240
Say that again, Hippo!

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.550
We can't find boyfriends!? Who are you referring to?

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:02.130
I let what I've held in my heart for so long slip out of my mouth.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:03.730
Quit joking around!{Quit fucking joking around!}

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.270
You damn penguin!

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:06.820
How about I break you so you can't walk!?

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:09.710
Calm down, everyone!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.790
Love Detective

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.530
Rina-chan, what are you doing out here?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.860
Oh, nothing much. I'm just spacing out here alone.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.880
I see.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.700
Look at that. Rina and that guy seem to be getting along really well.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.940
Now that I think about it, when Rina's kingdom was having their Summer Green Festival,

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.840
Rina was talking about someone who isn't just a friend.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.270
Maybe it's that guy?

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:01.710
Yeah. He's Hamasaki Masahiro-san.

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:04.010
Lately, they've been getting really close.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:09.530
But both of them are really slow, and they've made no progress at all.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.000
Wait a minute, Hanon!

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:15.350
No! We can't just ignore the needs of someone like Rina.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:19.600
We all need to get together so the two of them will make progress in their relationship.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.070
That's right! That's right!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.830
Okay! In that case, let us investigate this guy.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.080
Coco, Noelle, Karen...

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.600
You seem to have a handle on the situation.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:33.760
I think they're trying to kill some of their summer time.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.890
Moron! Moron!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:48.040
Yay! You did it! You're incredible!

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.300
Hamasaki-kun, is this really your first time bowling?

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.840
Yeah. Bowling seems to be really interesting.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.250
Wow! You're so good!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.480
Hamasaki-kun, you're good at everything {that }you do.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:03.640
Look at that. We can see how he is on the outside.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:06.500
But do we really have the talent to be detectives?

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.490
Yeah, yeah... of course we do...

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:14.220
In any case, Rina needs to put a leash on her boyfriend.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:18.030
More like, I'll never forgive him for betraying Rina.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:20.670
Maybe he's one of those people who has a lot of friends who are girls.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.390
But he really has a way with women.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.100
Isn't that looking for an excuse for him?

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:29.900
In situations like this, we should look at the worst-case scenario.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:31.510
The worst-case scenario?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:36.820
He takes whatever women he can get, uses them, then tosses them aside.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:38.600
He could be a playboy!

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:39.980
How could that be?

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.220
No matter what, he can't be that bad.

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:45.180
It looks like we're going to have to use bait to investigate this.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:47.100
"Bait?"

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.170
Is that your motorcycle?

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:51.030
Eh?

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:55.980
It's an incredible motorcycle. I was wondering who rides it.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.090
I knew it was someone wonderful.

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:00.400
Who are you?

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:05.050
It doesn't matter. I was just interested in your motorcycle.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.080
May I?

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:12.240
My goodness, can't she say something better when flirting with him?

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:14.250
Her lines are so cheesy!

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:19.120
Will we really find out if he's sincere by using bait?

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:25.380
Since he's never seen Karen before, if he accepts her flirting, that proves that he's a degenerate playboy.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:29.130
Aren't you Rina-chan's friend?

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:32.680
Ah! We've been found out!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:36.800
This attempt is a failure. It appears that Karen doesn't have the talent to be a detective.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:37.960
Huh?

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:43.400
He took Karen and left.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.160
What's going on?

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:48.350
He confuddled Karen as Rina's friend?

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:52.380
You should use "confused" instead. You sound really old.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:56.860
You said that you wanted to talk to me about something. What is it?

00:06:57.190 --> 00:07:00.350
I need to discuss something with you.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.870
Discuss with me?

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:06.140
We're back.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:09.070
Ah! Welcome back, Coco, Noelle. Where did you go?

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:12.200
Uhh!{Oh no!} We didn't really go anywhere!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.750
W-We were just talking a walk around the area.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.600
Hmm, all right.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.440
Lunch will be ready soon. Do you want some?

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:21.080
Of course!

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.880
What's for lunch?

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:25.860
I'm really looking forward to it!

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.760
That scared me!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.990
Rina just showed up all of a sudden.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:32.530
But what do we do?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:35.390
It's going to be difficult to break the news of what just happened to Rina.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:36.300
What are you doing?

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.710
Eeep!

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:38.840
Coco, Noelle.

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:41.640
I see that you two are gossiping.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:45.010
Did you get anything on Hamasaki-kun?

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.200
We caught up to Hamasaki-san...

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:51.760
And then Karen went with him...

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:56.850
Eh!? Hamasaki-san took Karen on his motorcycle?

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.410
Oww!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.800
Shh! Hanon, you're too{ damn} loud!

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:03.100
Sorry.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.620
Sorry for bringing you out here all of a sudden.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.790
T-That's okay. I don't mind.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:12.600
So what did you want to ask me?

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.470
I felt something the first time I saw her.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.120
I feel like I love her, and it won't stop.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.190
Don't you think that feeling is strange?

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:23.270
Eh? It's not strange.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:28.480
Huh? Did this guy fall in love with me at first sight?

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.720
Ah, is everyone here?

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.690
You're just in time, lunch is ready...

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:35.620
Listen, Rina!

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:39.590
There are better things out there, so it's better to start over sooner than later.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.410
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.430
Wait a minute, Noelle! I don't think it's like that.

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:46.140
Eh?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.070
You must use all your strength to take back what has been stolen from you.

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:52.450
That's the true meaning of love!

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.780
What are you two talking about?

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:59.050
Lucia, come here...

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.330
Eh!? Karen and Hamasaki-san?

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:09.640
Lucia, your voice is too loud! Rina will hear you!

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.830
S-Sorry.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:15.010
Anyway, Coco and Noelle think that telling Rina would break her heart.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:20.470
But they seem to have already made preparations to lessen the shock once she finds out.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:23.930
Why do they have to plan something so difficult?

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.680
I think this is just going to make her less likely to accept it.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.480
I knew it. You think so too, Lucia?

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:30.400
Yeah.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.050
T-To say this so suddenly, I...

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:38.690
I'm in love. In my eyes, there's no other girl.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:42.760
Oh no! What about Rina?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.790
No! This mustn't happen!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:47.400
It's hard when you're torn between friendship and love.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.870
What should I do?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.320
Ah, I'm so stuffed! Thanks for the meal!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.550
By the way, where's Karen?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.450
W-Where did she go?

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:08.190
She must be on a date with a lionfish!

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:11.790
On a date with a lionfish? Huh?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.620
This isn't going to work.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.730
They're really forcing it.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.190
What are the two of you trying to say?

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:20.730
You guys are talking in a really roundabout way.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.130
It makes me think that you're trying to hide something.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.200
We're not hiding anything from you! We're definitely not hiding anything!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.630
That's right! That's right!

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:30.040
Did we hide where Karen went?

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:34.070
Oww! What are you doing, Noelle?

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.900
Why are you letting details slip out!?

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.720
Are you an idiot?

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:45.230
Wait, Rina. How do you feel about what we talked about before, about finding someone new to love?

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:48.900
I don't understand what you were even talking about in the first place.

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:52.030
Talking about love is not something I do well.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:55.520
I don't even think about it.

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:56.430
See you later.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:11:00.010
So, you don't feel anything for that Hamasaki guy?

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.770
Don't worry about it, Rina!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:06.180
Coco must have eaten something weird for her to say something like that.

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.600
Yeah, you can tell me the truth.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:14.180
The whole truth?

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:19.100
He may have fallen in love with me at first sight, but it's kinda cute that he can't say it.

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.060
The whole truth, huh?

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:25.150
She treats people coldly, and she doesn't really have an aura of a girl.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:28.150
Eh? Does that mean she doesn't have any good points?

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:34.030
Actually, my personal opinion, I think she is quite feminine.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:35.380
I-Is that so?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.370
I guess she has aspects that I don't know at all.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.310
That's right!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.450
I want to know more about Rina-chan.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.670
He said... he wanted to know more about Rina.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:50.820
I see now.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:54.960
Moron!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.600
Hey, Hanon. Do you know where Rina went?

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:09.770
I don't know.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.340
Ah, Karen!

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.540
How was the date with Hamasaki-san?

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.540
Nothing happened!

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.490
He only has eyes for Rina!

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:21.380
There is no other girl on his mind!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.220
He said that in front of such a good girl like me!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.240
I've never met someone so unsociable before!

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:29.490
Note: Karen says "bokunenjin" (unsociable), but Lucia and Hanon don't seem to know that word.

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:28.190
I... what person?

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:29.490
I... submission?

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:07.320
Rina-chan.

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.430
Masahiro.

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:12.590
Rina-chan, why are you here?

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:13.860
I could ask you the same question.

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:17.820
This is my favorite spot.

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.540
I really love looking at the scenery from here.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:25.020
When I have something to think about, I{ would} come here.

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:28.810
I can enjoy the scenery and clear my head at the same time.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.360
I see.

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.140
I guess I'll interfere with your thinking.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.320
I'll go on home.

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:36.730
Masahiro?

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:39.770
No, it's not just that.

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:46.230
Rina-chan, this place... is a place where I wanted to be able to take you to some day!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:50.670
This is also my favorite spot.

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:56.330
Because this is the favorite spot for both of us, I'm really happy.

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.130
Rina-chan.

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.440
I'm happy for Rina.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:06.850
Yeah.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:09.980
Huh?

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:10.720
That's...

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:22.190
Mermaid Princesses, you still won't lend me your power?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.120
Mikeru!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:25.300
This is your last chance.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:30.470
Don't you want to lend me your strength to reform this hopeless world?

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:35.890
We would never... no, from now on, we will never be able to work with you, ever!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:40.080
That's because the world isn't as hopeless as you say it is!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.450
Hmmph. You're a fool.

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:44.020
A fool?

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:47.060
Hold on! Why are we fools?

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:51.130
You are fools because you do not see how people have polluted themselves.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:55.720
What are you talking about? This world is full of people's love!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:58.660
Love? You really are bunch of fools.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.070
Love is full of betrayal.

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.480
You think love is eternal?

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:07.310
Have you ever felt heartbroken because your love had a change of heart?

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:14.930
Kai... to...

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:21.290
You've experienced it, but you still believe that this defiled world has love? You really are a fool.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.470
I wonder about that!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.230
Rina!

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:29.400
You're here!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:32.950
Three of the Mermaid Princesses are here.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:35.110
Let's put aside such useless words for now.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.770
Now, give me your power.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:40.840
I pity you.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.180
What did you say?

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:48.290
I said that I pity you.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:51.040
You pity... me?

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.980
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:07.290
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.620
Green Pearl Voice!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.590
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:31.880
"I pity you?" She said, "I pity you?"

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:37.320
You're just a bunch of{ damn} mermaids! Don't joke with me!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.500
My strength is leaving me.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.630
Oh no!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:55.270
I am taking your powers for the sake of making this world good!

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.710
Stop!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.120
This is punishment for making me angry.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:10.290
Now say, "I don't believe in love! Love has no value!"

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.880
No, I believe in love!

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:16.230
That's right! We won't lose to you!

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:16.990
What?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.130
You still don't understand, do you?

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:23.550
We won't ever yield to your power!

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:28.570
There are times when there is suffering and sadness!

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:32.540
However, we'll never forget the heart that believes in love!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.480
This... this is our strength!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.850
What is this light?

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:41.420
If only this body were more complete...

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:01.860
Thank you, Lucia.

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:05.570
This is what comes from the heart.

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:07.940
Love without words, right?

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:08.910
It's beautiful.

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:12.880
Seira.

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:53.080
You're really cute!

00:23:53.080 --> 00:23:55.370
Eh? I'm not that cute.

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:58.410
Cute girls are my rivals, though.

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:01.870
I'll knock you out with my cute song!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:03.220
Who are you?

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:07.290
I'm Alala, the super idol for the new world.

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:10.560
All the men in the world will burn with desire for me!

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:12.710
Ugh! What's with her?

00:24:12.710 --> 00:24:15.700
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:15.700 --> 00:24:17.260
Intrusion of Love.

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:19.480
I'm firing at your heart!
